0 TwistSpan — bifilar torsion pendulum (64 mm tie spacing)
0 Name: twistspan.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../licenses/twistspan.txt
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // One hub, one useful motor, one independent unpowered payload.
0 // All anchors remain installed. The comparison changes ONLY the two cord routes.
0 // Two 104 mm effective fixed cords. Knots and flexible contact are not simulated.
0 // Red collars: 64 mm spacing; green collars: 32 mm spacing.
0 // No invisible joints, prescribed payload poses, static chassis, or collision overrides.
